sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor Athlete
  participant UI as CoachConnect
  participant API as Next.js booking route
  participant Auth as Supabase Auth
  participant DB as PostgreSQL RPC
  actor Coach

  Athlete->>UI: Choose an open future slot
  UI->>API: Request booking
  API->>Auth: Verify member session
  Auth-->>API: Authenticated member ID
  API->>DB: request_coach_booking
  DB->>DB: Recheck coach, slot, self-booking and conflicts
  alt Slot is no longer available
    DB-->>API: Conflict
    API-->>UI: Ask athlete to choose another slot
  else Request stored
    DB-->>API: Pending booking
    API-->>UI: Show pending request
    DB-->>Coach: Request appears in Sessions
    Coach->>API: Accept or decline
    API->>DB: respond_to_coach_booking
    DB-->>UI: Both schedules show the same result
  end

  opt Accepted booking
    Coach->>API: Add participant-only meeting details
    API->>DB: Save private meeting details
    DB-->>Athlete: Sessions notification becomes available
  end

  opt Cancellation or completion
    Athlete->>API: Cancel eligible booking
    Coach->>API: Cancel or complete eligible booking
    API->>DB: Apply one atomic state transition
    DB-->>UI: Show status and demo refund-policy outcome
  end

  Note over Athlete,Coach: CoachConnect records demo accounting only and never transfers money.
